      "id": "architecture-of-debt-money-and-interest:s01:c00",
      "article_id": "architecture-of-debt-money-and-interest",
      "title": "The Architecture of Debt-Money and Interest: A Qurʾānic Diagnosis",
      "section": "Front matter and preface",
      "section_number": 1,
