      "text": "Azfar Samin is an independent researcher with an interest in the Qurʾān, systems thinking, and comparative worldview analysis. He occasionally dabbles in finance and economics. His work focuses on examining truth claims from first principles, with particular attention to coherence, correspondence with reality, and the conditions under which belief systems can be judged consistently across a shared set of criteria.\n\nAs for his geolocation, he aspires to live in the city of Truth, and the land where people follow what constrains them to it.",
