      "text": "Forming Coherent Belief Systems\n   The next chapter introduces such a method: a structured epistemic framework\nthat evaluates truth along three axes — coherence, correspondence, and calibration.\nIt is through this framework that we will examine the following question:\n    Does the Qurʾān present a model of reality that satisfies the conditions of\n     truth when evaluated under the same criteria as its alternatives?\n   The journey begins by understanding the method through which truth itself can\nbe tested.\n\n                                20",
