      "text": "CCC as a Reasoning-Based Model\n   The CCC Framework is not built on faith but on the basis of procedural\nrationality. Its starting point is simple:\n   Here is the data of reality—material world, lived moral experience, human\npsychology. Apply the reasoning tools we already employ in our normal daily life, to\ndetermine which explanation—revelatory or non-revelatory systems—fits best across\n\n                                33",
