      "text": "39 François Déroche, Qurʾāns of the Umayyads (Leiden: Brill, 2014).\n40 Behnam Sadeghi and Mohsen Goudarzi, Sana'a 1 and the Origins of the Qurʾān, Der\nIslam 87 (2012): 1–3.\n41 A palimpsest is a manuscript page or parchment from which text has been erased so that it\ncan be reused for another writing.\n42 Behnam Sadeghi and Uwe Bergmann, “The Codex of a Companion of the Prophet and the\nQurʾān of the Prophet,” Arabica 57 (2010).\n                                58",
