      "text": "Reason, Revelation and the Architecture of Truth\nSummary\n    Unlike earlier scriptures, the Qurʾān is still universally recited, memorized at\nscale, and lived in its original Arabic—the same Arabic in which it claims revelation\n(Q 12:2; 20:113; 26:195; 43:3). From a linguistic, historical, and sociological\nstandpoint, the empirical record supports and is consistent with the Qurʾān’s claim\nin Q 15:9, revealing a uniquely living, self-verifying and stable text preserved\nthrough written transmission and distributed human stewardship.47\n\nTable 3.2\nQurʾānic preservation claim verification on the CCC axis.\n\n                        Nature of\n        Axis                              Empirical Mechanism             Effect\n                          Preservation\n\n Coherence (Truth of   Internal linguistic    Pan-textual consistency   Constrains doctrinal drift\n Structure)              precision and         of morphology, syntax,   and alteration through\n                       thematic unity      and root-usage,            structural interlock\n                                                    linguistic and structural\n                                                  integrity\n\n Correspondence        Stability of          Convergence of all       Confirms semantic\n (Truth of Reality)     meaning and         qirāʾāt on identical       preservation despite\n                        doctrine              theological and moral     phonetic variance; textual\n                                              content; Manuscript       stability\n                                              empirical evidence\n\n Calibration (Truth    Ongoing human     Dual redundancy of      Creates a self-correcting\n of Measurement)       verification          written rasm + oral ḥifẓ   system that detects and\n                                           (memorization)           corrects doctrinal\n                                                                        deviation",
