      "title": "Reason, Revelation, and the Architecture of Truth: A Framework for Evaluating Worldviews",
      "section": "AI Systems as an Analogy",
      "section_number": 167,
      "chunk_number": 0,
      "source_path": "research/articles/reason-revelation-and-the-architecture-of-truth.md",
