      "text": "                                                                              Regularity: Fire burns,\nWhat is observed?       Button → effect       Cause → effect\n                                                                               seeds grow\n                                               Experience imposed on    Observation and\nHow is this learned?      Repetition during play\n                                                      existing mental categories  experience (induction)\n Does repetition create                    No—the mind supplies\n                 No                              No\n the rule?                                        the rule a priori\nWhere does the “must”\n                        Outside the game       Inside the mind          Outside creation\ncome from?\n                                      The mind’s a priori       Divine command\nWho enforces the rule?   The game system\n                                                    structures               (amr)\nCan regularity be                     No (fixed by mental        Yes, by divine will. ‘Be’\n                           Yes, by the rule source\n overridden?                                        structure)        — and it is\n                                                                            External and\nWhere is the law giver?   External                Internal\n                                                                              ontological\n Consistent with CCC\n                        Yes             No                      Yes\n triad?\n\n    Closing the loop with the video game analogy, just as motion in animation\ndepends on externally imposed sequencing rules by a “proxy creator,” and just as\n\n                                175",
