      "text": "Reason, Revelation and the Architecture of Truth\n\nFigure 8.1: Structured accumulation of evidence across five independent inference layers.\n\n                RELIABILITY OF THE DATA\n                              (Preservation Fit)\n                 Can the text even be evaluated?\n\n         COMPARATIVE EXPLANATORY POWER\n                    (World Scripture Analysis)\n          Does it outperform rivals, not by assertion but by fit?\n\n            UNIVERSAL REASONING TOOLS\n                             (Philosopher’s Toolkit)\n         Does it provide principles to think, reason and evaluate?\n\n         COMPREHENSIVE EXPLANATORY SCOPE\n                      (Seven Domains of Philosophy)\n       Does it offer a total map of reality while other systems offer\n                              fragments?\n\n        EXPLANATION OF HUMAN INTELLIGENCE\n                 (Tri-modal architecture of intelligence)\n           Does it align with the reasoning, observing, judging\n                      architecture built into all humans?\n\n           Cumulative Rational Inference of CCC Framework\n\n                                185",
