      "topics": [],
      "text": "O you who were given the Scripture, believe in what We \nhave sent down [to Muḥammad (ṣ)], confirming that \nwhich is with you, before We obliterate faces and turn \nthem toward their backs or curse them as We cursed the \nsabbath-breakers. And ever is the matter [i.e., decree] of \nAllāh accomplished. \n(4:47)\n\nAnd to Allāh belongs whatever is in the heavens and \nwhatever is on the earth. And We have instructed those \nwho were given the Scripture before you and yourselves \nto fear Allāh. But if you disbelieve — then to Allāh belongs \nwhatever is in the heavens and whatever is on the earth. \nAnd ever is Allāh Free of need and Praiseworthy. \n(4:131)\n\nThis day [all] good foods have been made lawful, and \nthe food of those who were given the Scripture is lawful \nfor you and your food is lawful for them. And [lawful in \nmarriage are] chaste women from among the believers \nand chaste women from among those who were given \nthe Scripture before you, when you have given them their \ndue compensation, desiring chastity, not unlawful sexual \nintercourse or taking [secret] lovers. And whoever denies",
