      "text": "qaḍā (baina + personal pronoun object) + bil ḥaqqi\n39:69, 39:75, 40:20, 40:78.\n\nṣadaqa + concrete object + bil ḥaqqi\n48:27.\n\nsamaʿa + concrete object + bil ḥaqqi\n50:42.\n\nal ḥaqq\ni.\nWhere al ḥaqq operates as a nominative noun or as an object it \nmeans (the) truth or (the) true\n\n2:26, 2:42, 2:42, 2:91, 2:109, 2:144, 2:146, 2:147, 2:149, 2:213, \n3:60, 3:62, 3:71, 3:71, 3:154, 4:171, 5:48, 5:77, 5:83, 5:84, 6:57, \n6:62, 6:66, 6:73, 6:93, 7:8, 7:105, 7:118, 7:169, 8:6, 8:7, 8:8, 8:32, \n9:29, 9:33, 9:48, 10:30, 10:32, 10:32, 10:35, 10:35, 10:35, 10:36, \n10:76, 10:77, 10:82, 10:94, 10:108, 11:17, 11:45, 11:120, 12:51, \n13:1, 13:14, 13:17, 13:19, 14:22, 17:81, 18:29, 18:44, 18:56, \n19:34, 20:114, 21:24, 21:97, 22:6, 22:54, 22:62, 23:70, 23:71, \n23:116, 24:25, 24:25, 24:49, 25:26, 27:79, 28:48, 28:53, 28:75, \n31:30, 32:3, 33:4, 33:53, 34:6, 34:23, 34:43, 34:49, 35:31, 38:84, \n38:84, 40:5, 41:53, 42:18, 42:24, 43:29, 43:30, 46:7, 46:30, 47:2, \n47:3, 48:28, 53:28, 57:16, 60:1, 61:9, 78:39.",
