      "text": "1 We sent Noah to his people: “Warn thou thy people before a painful punishment \ncome\n1 to them.”\n2 He said: “O my people: I am to you a clear warner:\n3 “Serve God, and be in prudent fear\n1 of Him, and obey me.\n2\n\n4 “He will forgive you of your transgressions,\n1 and delay you to a stated term; the \nterm of God, when it comes, cannot be delayed, if you but knew.”\n5 He said: “My Lord: I have called my people night and day,\n\n1 \nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Genesis_flood_narrative",
