      "text": "73 Then they denied him;\n1 so We delivered him, and those with him in the ship, and \nmade them successors, and We drowned those who denied Our proofs.\n2 Then see \nthou how was the final outcome of those who had been warned!\n(10:71-73)\n\nNoah here resorts to what we will come to see is a common stratagem: he places his affair \nentirely in the hands of God and challenges the unbelievers to do their worst.",
