      "text": "73 And to Thamūd, their brother Ṣāliḥ.\n1 He said: “O my people: serve God; you have \nno god but He; there has come to you clear evidence from your Lord: this is the she-\ncamel of God, as a proof\n2 for you, so leave her to eat in God’s earth, and touch her not \nwith evil\n3 lest there take you a painful punishment.\n\n1 \nFrom Wikipedia as of March, 2021. This quote is included for general context; we do not mean to imply personal \nsupport for all details of its substance.",
      "source_kind": "third_party_book",
      "evidence_role": "argument_not_scripture",
      "external_discussion": false,
      "pdf_page": 43
