      "text": "Characteristic sins of the warner’s people\n\n• Idolatry (taking a god other than God).\n\n• Preference for idolatry when presented with a call to God.\n\n• Refusal to heed legitimate warning.\n\n• Committing evil in the earth.\n\n4 \nAnd found at 54:16, 54:18, 54:21, 54:30, 54:37, 54:39. The broader segment is included in Chapter 11.\n\n5 \nWe should bear in mind that the term proofs (Arabic: āyāt) comprises evidence of a range of types which includes the \nstatements of God.",
