      "verse_refs": [],
      "topics": [],
      "text": "If we are correct that Abraham’s people worshipped heavenly bodies, then we find this \ncharacteristic copiously mirrored today also with both the ruling elites and those they rule \nsubstantially embroiled in the notion of as above, so below albeit from differing perspectives.",
      "source_kind": "third_party_book",
      "evidence_role": "argument_not_scripture",
