      "verse_refs": [],
      "topics": [],
      "text": "The segments below each are indicated as generic narrative summaries by means of a negative \nconstruction in ‘save’ or a positive construction in ‘only’. Both constructions signal a standard \noutcome for all cases, the mission of Jonah being everywhere understood as the sole exception \nto a result of denial and subsequent destruction.\n\n8 \nQur’anic parlance for the people of Lot whose case we review in the next chapter.",
      "source_kind": "third_party_book",
      "evidence_role": "argument_not_scripture",
