      "text": "90 O you who heed warning:\n1 wine,\n2 and games of chance, and altars,\n3 and divining \narrows\n4 are an abomination of the work of the satan;\n5 so avoid it, that you might be \nsuccessful.\n(5:90)\n\n23 A ruler has the right — even a duty — to execute those who commit certain crimes, but that question is beyond the \nremit of the present work.\n\n24 According to Death By Government by R. J. Rummel (1994).",
      "source_kind": "third_party_book",
