      "topics": [],
      "text": "The God Protocol\n298\n\nif not synonymous, at least likely to be experienced as such.\n\nWe turn in our closing chapter to the subject of how the notification we have identified to \ncomplete Muḥammad’s second, unique mission of warning under the protocol might be \ndelivered to the ruling elites of our time.",
      "source_kind": "third_party_book",
