      "text": "Key to Tables\n\nEXP = event explicitly mentioned in text\n\nGNS = event identified by means of generic narrative summaries\n\nCHARACTERISTIC SINS OF WARNER’S PEOPLE\nNOAH\nHŪD\nṢĀLIḤABRAHAM\nLOT\nSHUʿAYB\nMOSES\nMUHAMMAD\nTUBBAʿ\nAL-RASS\nIRAM\nUNNAMED\n\nPerfidy of the wealthy after warning followed by punishment being \nmade binding.\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\n\nCommunity to be warned given affliction followed by blessings.\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\n\nCommunity to be warned became indifferent to the blessings of God.\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\n\nMultiple sins (see chapter 12).\nEXP\n\nSorcery (use of manipulations to control the minds of men for \npolitical purposes).\nEXP\n\nThe State as god\nEXP\n\nDisregard for the laws of God.\nEXP\n\nKilling men and sparing women.\nEXP\n\nAggression against believers in God.\nEXP\n\nEconomic corruption and oppression.\nEXP\n\nSodomy (sexual relations between men).\nEXP\n\nCommitting evil in the earth.\nEXP\n\nUnbridled hubris.\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\n\nExcessive cruelty.\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\n\nRefusal to heed legitimate warning.\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\n\nSexual coupling outside legal limits. \nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\n\nIdolatry (taking a god other than God).\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\n\nGenetic manipulations and / or miscegenation.\nEXP\n\nPolytheism (worship of multiple gods).\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\n\nPreference for idolatry when presented with a call to God.\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP",
