      "text": "Addresses himself to the elites of his time.\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nGNS\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\n\nCalls the hearers to abandon idols.\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nEXP\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nEXP\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\n\nCalls the hearers to fear God.\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nGNS\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\n\nAsserts that there is but one true God.\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nGNS\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\n\nCORE ACTIONS\n\nCalls the hearers to serve God only.\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nEXP\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\n\nACTIONS OF WARNER\nNOAH\nHŪD\nṢĀLIḤ\nABRAHAM\nLOT\nSHUʿAYB\nMOSES\nMUHAMMAD\nTUBBAʿ AL-RASS\nIRAM\nUNNAMED\n\nCalls the hearers to serve God.\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nGNS\nEXP\nGNS\nEXP\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\n\nComes with clear signs, writings, or the Illuminating Writ.\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\n\nWarns the principal city.\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nEXP\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\n\nSpeaks in the language of those he warns.\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nEXP\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\n\nApproaches a people to which he belongs.\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nGNS\nEXP\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\n\nEats food and walks in the markets.\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nEXP\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\n\nTold by God that the wrongdoers will be destroyed.\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nGNS\nEXP\nGNS\nEXP\nEXP\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\n\nReceives a commission from God.\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nGNS\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\n\nCalls the hearers to seek forgiveness of God.\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nGNS\nGNS\nEXP\nGNS\nEXP\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\n\nWarns of the Resurrection.\nEXP\nGNS\nGNS\nEXP\nGNS\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\n\nClaims better guidance than that of hearers.\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nEXP\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\n\nCites need to place trust in God.\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nEXP\nEXP\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\n\nCites need for patience.\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nEXP\nEXP\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\n\nCites guidance of God.\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nEXP\nGNS\nGNS\nEXP\nEXP\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\n\nSays God can delay to a stated term.\nEXP\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nEXP\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS",
