      "text": "*up to and including Moses; thereafter we concentrate only on actions of warner.\n\nThe conclusion of the matter entails a proof.\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\n\nThe idolaters’ cult fails them.\nEXP\nEXP\n\nEvery obstinate tyrant both fails and is damned.\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\n\nTHE CONCLUSION OF THE MATTER*\nNOAH\nHŪD\nṢĀLIḤ\nABRAHAM\nLOT\nSHUʿAYB\nMOSES\nTUBBAʿ AL-RASS\nIRAM\nUNNAMED\n\nTemporal power of no consequence in the face of God’s \ndecision.\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\n\nThe community warned can neither defer nor hasten \ndestruction.\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\n\nGod seizes the rejecters with a surpassing grip.\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nEXP\nGNS\nEXP\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\n\nThose destroyed are caught suddenly and unawares. \nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nEXP\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\n\nThose destroyed are destroyed for what they did.\nGNS\nGNS\nEXP\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nEXP\nGNS\nGNS\nEXP\nGNS\n\nThe late repentance of the deniers does not save them.\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\n\nThe deniers are surrounded by that at which they mocked.\nGNS\nEXP\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\n\nIt was said: “Away with[...]”.\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nGNS\nGNS\nEXP\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\n\nThe rejecters will go to Hell.\nEXP\nEXP\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nEXP\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\n\nGod destroys the committers of excess.\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\n\nGod fulfils His promise to the warners.\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\n\nGod delivers the warner and those who believed with him.\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\n\nGod annihilates those who reject the warner.\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nGNS\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nGNS\nGNS\n\nGod does not wrong them, but they wronged their souls.\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nEXP\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS\nGNS",
